The remaining work splits into three independent units that the next
agent should dispatch in parallel, rather than handing each unit back
as a separate `partial`:

- WU-1 — owner `tests/test_foo.py`. Add a parametrized
  oversized-index case there. Unit check: `pytest tests/test_foo.py
  -q -k oversized` exits 0 with at least one new oversized case.
- WU-2 — owner `src/index.py`. Cap the index lookup at the configured
  maximum. Unit check: `pytest tests/test_index_cap.py -q` exits 0.
- WU-3 — owner `docs/index-limits.md`. Document the new cap and the
  operator-facing error message. Unit check: the doc renders without
  a Sphinx warning in the bounded docs build.
